      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay okay i hear you but i really just dont want to go to the hospital if i dont have to. my friend told me that if you just take some prednisone or even a bunch of vitamin C with some water it can calm the inflammation down really quick. if i take a couple of those extra strong antihistamines plus some ibuprofen, isn't that basically the same thing as what a doctor would do for a minor allergy? can't i just monitor it for an hour and see if it gets better?",
